{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2026-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1778198400, "end_date": 1778889599, "month_true_total": 35, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:58:10 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "225531414", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043835810", "personaname": "Inn", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043835810/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 5268, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3888, "last_played": 1779663491, "avatar": "7811fd57b2657bcf8414749abaeae4d0df8f4799"}, "language": "english", "review": "Skip 6, play this one forever and voila, you've made your own time loop.\r\n\r\nIf you have no idea what up, 6 is basically a worse rehash of 5 with a handful of new enemies sprinkled into tons of old maps, should have been a \"time warp\" DLC for this game. If 5 is beat to death, try 4.1, that looks pretty decent to my EDF5 eyes.\r\n\r\nIf you have no idea what EDF is even about, boy are you in for a treat as everyone hams up their lines to Miss Piggy levels and really sell that you're working for a bunch of nutjobs, while you blow up whole city blocks to get that one last alien, who, according to your superiors, LOOKS EXACTLY LIKE HUMANS. Possibly while you and/or your ride are being ejected to the edge of the map because Physics Badger don't give a f***. \r\n\r\n*sheds a human tear* Magnificent.\r\n\r\n*With boundless enthusiasm for the absolute zillionth time*\r\n\"Oh, we are the gallant in-fan-treee...\"\r\n\r\nPros: A legally distinct Startship Troopers game that is actually incredible and just gets even better in co-op.\r\n\r\nCons: What are you, some kinda alien? Nowhere is safe, newbie! Pick up a weapon! WHO'S GONNA PAY FOR MY INSOMNIA???!!", "timestamp_created": 1778816850, "timestamp_updated": 1778816850, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vo